WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.607
This view joins employees to departments and sales orders.

00:00:03.607 --> 00:00:06.552
It aggregates orders and sales amount.

00:00:06.552 --> 00:00:10.257
One output row represents one employee.

00:00:10.257 --> 00:00:18.029
Because this definition can support several operations reports, publishing it as a reusable view is reasonable.
